  "title": "Karnataka Sugarcane Crisis: CM Shivakumar Calls for Government Intervention",
  "summary": "The Chief Minister of Karnataka, D.K. Shivakumar, has called for the Centre to address the sugarcane farmers' demands, emphasizing the need for collaboration among stakeholders and the preparation of local body polls to secure support. Karnataka's state government has also announced plans to meet with sugar factory owners and the Centre to resolve ongoing issues.",
