    {
      "statement": "Karnataka's state government has announced plans to meet with sugar factory owners and the Centre to resolve ongoing issues.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "statement": "The government has rejected claims of ethanol diversion but acknowledged supply shortages.",
